### Test SMS functionality in Auth Controller - Updated with working Vietnam prefixes

### 1. Test with Vinaphone prefix (+8491)
POST https://localhost:5201/api/auths/forgot-password/send-sms-otp
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "phoneNumber": "+84912345678"
}

###

### 2. Test with Mobifone prefix (+8490)
POST https://localhost:5201/api/auths/forgot-password/send-sms-otp
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "phoneNumber": "+84903456789"
}

###

### 3. Test with Viettel different prefix (+8497)
POST https://localhost:5201/api/auths/forgot-password/send-sms-otp
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "phoneNumber": "+84976543210"
}

###

### 4. Test with your real number (replace with actual)
POST https://localhost:5201/api/auths/forgot-password/send-sms-otp
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "phoneNumber": "+84[your-real-number]"
}

###

### 5. Verify SMS OTP
POST https://localhost:5201/api/auths/forgot-password/verify-sms-otp
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "phoneNumber": "+84912345678",
  "code": "123456"
}

